  "description": "A dependency injection abstraction layer over ImGui implementations for .NET. Wraps Hexa.NET.ImGui behind clean interfaces (IImGuiProvider, IImGuiBackend) enabling swappable backends, testable UI code, and standard DI integration via Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection.",
